# Provider downloads — never committed.
.terraform/

# Deliberately NOT committed. `.terraform.lock.hcl` records per-PLATFORM package hashes, so a
# lock generated on a maintainer's darwin_arm64 laptop makes `tofu init` fail on the runner's
# linux_amd64 with "provider does not have a package for the current platform". The runner
# inits these modules itself; let it resolve providers for the platform it is actually on.
.terraform.lock.hcl

# There is no backend here (the runner injects a state-proxy override), so a local state file
# only ever appears by accident — but if it does, it must not be published.
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
